  "body": "Perfectly positioned in a prime Millwater location, within easy walking distance of shops, sought-after schools and public transport, this beautifully presented residence delivers space, comfort and effortless family or retirement living.\r\nThoughtfully designed and enhanced with a range of quality features, the home includes a gas fireplace, ducted heating and cooling, a rooflight flooding the kitchen with natural light, an enlarged pantry and tons of storage.\r\nFour generous double bedrooms provide plenty of room for the whole family, complemented by two well-appointed bathrooms. The modern kitchen sits at the heart of the home, flowing seamlessly into the spacious open-plan family and dining area, while a separate formal living room provides valuable flexibility for busy households needing a quieter, private space to retire to.\r\nOutside, the fully fenced section features expansive, private west-facing decking, capturing beautiful afternoon sun and creating the perfect setting for entertaining, family barbecues or simply relaxing at the end of the day. Double garaging and easy-care landscaping complete the package.\r\nSpacious, stylish and superbly located, this home will tick plenty of boxes. With the vendors now living overseas, this is an opportunity not to be missed by those wanting a family home, retirement home or a really well-equipped investment property.",
